For each group, calculate the required contribution using its own configuration:
\[ \text{ Group contribution pool} = \text{Contribution amount} \times \text{Configured co-saver capacity} \]
For example, a £50 contribution with 20 co-savers produces a £1,000 gross contribution pool per collection period.
The calculation must never use a global contribution amount.
